  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIVE SECONDARY SCHOOLS PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EACH COLLEGE D&apos;ENSEIGNMENT GENERAL (CEG) WILL COMPRISE: (A) SIX CLASS ROOMS (63 SQ.M. EACH) (B) ONE LABORATORY (136 SQ.M.) (C) ONE ADMINISTRATIVE BLOCK (160 SQ.M.) (D) TWO HOUSING UNITS (120 SQ.M.EACH) (E) TWO SANITARY BLOCKS., ON THE BASIS OF 40 PUPILS PER CLASS_ROOM.</narrative>
  </description>
